<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>The book “La prosa nunca está terminada “, which has just been published by the Diego Portales University, brings together a selection of texts by Manuel Rojas dealing with literature. These writings show us an attentive and thoughtful author, thinking about his art and other writers, such as Horacio Quiroga, Vicente Huidobro, Gonzalez Vera and Alberto Edwards.</strong></p>
